				<h1 id="firstHeading" class="firstHeading mw-first-heading"><span class="mw-page-title-main">Defect</span></h1>
				<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body">
					<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From Slay the Spire Wiki</div>
					<div id="contentSub"></div>
					<div id="contentSub2"></div>
					
					<div id="jump-to-nav"></div>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#mw-head">Jump to navigation</a>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#searchInput">Jump to search</a>
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="game-tabber noexcerpt"><div class="game-tab" style="border: 2px solid var(--wiki-accent-color--hover); border-bottom: none;"><a class="mw-selflink selflink">Slay the Spire</a></div> <div class="game-tab"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Defect" title="Slay the Spire 2:Defect">Slay the Spire 2</a></div></div>
<div class="druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt" id="druid-container-1"><div><div class="druid-title">The Defect</div></div><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-main-images"><div class="druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs"><div class="druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused" data-druid="1-1" data-druid-tab-key="Combat">Combat</div></div><div class="druid-main-images-files"><div class="druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable focused" data-druid="1-1" data-druid-tab-key="Combat"><a href="/wiki/File:Defect.png" class="image"><img alt="Defect.png" src="/images/Defect.png?43d361" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="305" height="283" data-file-width="305" data-file-height="283" /></a></div><div class="druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable" data-druid="1-2">[[File:]]</div></div></div></div><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-row druid-row-MaxHealth" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-label druid-label-MaxHealth">Max Health</div><div class="druid-data druid-data-MaxHealth druid-data-nonempty">
75(<span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="14" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">71</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">14</span></sup></span>) Health</div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-EnergyIcon" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-label druid-label-EnergyIcon">Energy Icon</div><div class="druid-data druid-data-EnergyIcon druid-data-nonempty">
<span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@BE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="BlueEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/32px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="32" height="32" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/48px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/64px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span></div></div></div><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-row druid-row-Desc" data-druid-section-row="Flavor"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Desc druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
Combat automaton which became self-aware. Ancient technology allows manipulation of Orbs.</div></div></div></div>
<p>The <b>Defect</b> is one of the 4 playable characters in the game. It starts with 75 (<span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="14" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">71</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">14</span></sup></span>) max HP.
</p>
