<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Starting_Loadout">Starting Loadout</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Defect?veaction=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Starting Loadout" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Defect?action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Starting Loadout"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Starting_Relic">Starting Relic</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Defect?veaction=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Starting Relic" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Defect?action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Starting Relic"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<p><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Cracked Core" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Cracked_Core" title="Cracked Core"><img alt="CrackedCore.png" src="/images/thumb/CrackedCore.png/24px-CrackedCore.png?ede094" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/CrackedCore.png/36px-CrackedCore.png?ede094 1.5x, /images/thumb/CrackedCore.png/48px-CrackedCore.png?ede094 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Cracked_Core" title="Cracked Core">Cracked Core</a></span> - At the start of each combat, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Lightning" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><img alt="LightningOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/18px-LightningOrb.png?295517" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/27px-LightningOrb.png?295517 1.5x, /images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/36px-LightningOrb.png?295517 2x" data-file-width="70" data-file-height="70" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><span title="">Lightning</span></a></span> Orb.
Can be replaced by <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Frozen Core" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Frozen_Core" title="Frozen Core"><img alt="FrozenCore.png" src="/images/thumb/FrozenCore.png/24px-FrozenCore.png?d50abb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/FrozenCore.png/36px-FrozenCore.png?d50abb 1.5x, /images/thumb/FrozenCore.png/48px-FrozenCore.png?d50abb 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Frozen_Core" title="Frozen Core">Frozen Core</a></span>.
</p>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Starting_Deck">Starting Deck</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Defect?veaction=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Starting Deck" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Defect?action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Starting Deck"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strike (Defect)" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strike_(Defect)" title="Strike (Defect)"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Attack_Common.png?c26e25" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Attack_Common.png?c26e25 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strike_(Defect)" title="Strike (Defect)">Strike</a></span> x4</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Defend (Defect)" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Defend_(Defect)" title="Defend (Defect)"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png?667972" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png?667972 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Defend_(Defect)" title="Defend (Defect)">Defend</a></span> x4</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Zap" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Zap" title="Zap"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png?667972" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png?667972 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Zap" title="Zap">Zap</a></span> x1</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dualcast" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dualcast" title="Dualcast"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png?667972" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png?667972 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dualcast" title="Dualcast">Dualcast</a></span> x1</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Defect_Cards">Defect Cards</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Defect?veaction=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Defect Cards" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Defect?action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Defect Cards"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<p>There are a total of 71 regular cards in the Defect's card pool.
</p>
<ul><li><a href="/wiki/File:CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png" class="image"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png?667972" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png?667972 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Blue&amp;rarity=Common"><span>Common Cards</span></a></span> x18</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/File:CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png" class="image"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png?12d106" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png?12d106 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Blue&amp;rarity=Uncommon"><span>Uncommon Cards</span></a></span> x36</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/File:CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Rare.png" class="image"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Rare.png?abdc6f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Rare.png?abdc6f 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Blue&amp;rarity=Rare"><span>Rare Cards</span></a></span> x17</li></ul>
<p>A full list of Defect Cards can be found <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Blue"><span>here</span></a></span>.
</p>
